{
  "case_id": "SS-PASSWINDOW-26.1.2",
  "title": "飞星筹码「路过」判定：口径 B（水平 ≤3.0 + 脚底高差 ≤2.0）的四条边界 —— 同高/水平 2.5 收、+2 收、+3 拒、水平 3.5 拒",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "shooting-star-pass-window"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：验证飞星筹码「路过」判定在**收紧口径 B**（水平 ≤3.0 格 + 脚底高差 ≤2.0 格）下的四条边界，并证明旧 AABB 盒判据（水平 ±3.6 / 竖直 −3…+4.8）才是「跨高度触发」的成因。\n\n**判定口径（用户 2026-09-22 裁决 B）**：粗筛仍用 `inflate(R)` 的 AABB，但命中必须再过精筛 —— **水平距离 ≤ R（3.0 格，两实体中心）+ 脚底高差 ≤ 2.0 格**。\n⇒ 本用例的四段就是该口径的四条可证伪预言：\n  A 同高、水平 2.5 ⇒ **接受**；  B 高差 +2（窗口边界内）⇒ **接受**；\n  C 高差 +3（> 窗口 2.0）⇒ **拒绝**；  D 同高、水平 3.5（> 半径 3.0，旧 AABB 的 ±3.6 会误收）⇒ **拒绝**。\n`ssfire` 内部先置共享冷却 0 再调产品入口 ⇒ `cd_started=1` = 门槛接受、`cd_started=0` = 拒绝（单值读数）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "前置：生存 + 清背包 + **锁午夜**（白天僵尸会着火，血量按 ≈1/秒流失 ⇒ t_hp 断言全飘）；装钻石骰子（chip 槽由骰子星级决定）+ 紫色飞星；`ssclear` 清靶子并复位共享冷却。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule advance_time false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot dice \"astral_dice:diamond_dice\" A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"astral_dice:purple_shooting_star_chip\" A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "A 段：同高、水平 2.5 格 ⇒ 期望 **接受**（`cd_started=1`、靶子 20→19）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn A1 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear A1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B 段：抬高 **+2 格**（= 窗口 2.0 的上边界，含跳跃 1.25 与台阶 1）⇒ 期望 **接受**。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn B2 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/data merge entity @e[tag=astral_ss_target,limit=1] {NoGravity:1b}",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/execute as @e[tag=astral_ss_target,limit=1] at @s run tp @s ~ ~2 ~",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssgeom B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "C 段：抬高 **+3 格**（> 窗口 2.0；注意它**仍在旧 AABB 的 +4.8 之内**，旧口径会误收）⇒ 期望 **拒绝**（`cd_product=0:cd_started=0`、靶子恒 20 血）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn C3 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/data merge entity @e[tag=astral_ss_target,limit=1] {NoGravity:1b}",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/execute as @e[tag=astral_ss_target,limit=1] at @s run tp @s ~ ~3 ~",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssgeom C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear C3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "D 段：同高但**水平推远 1 格**（靶子自 ~ ~ ~ 再 +z 1 格 ⇒ 水平 3.5 格，仍与旧 AABB 的 ±3.6 相交、旧口径会误收）⇒ 期望 **拒绝**。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn D4 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/execute as @e[tag=astral_ss_target,limit=1] at @s run tp @s ~ ~ ~1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssgeom D4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire D4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread D4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread D4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread D4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear D9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_A1_SSFIRE:now=[0-9]+:cd_product=[0-9]+:cd_delta=200:cd_started=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_A1_SSREAD:.*:t_hp=19[^:]*:.*:t_alive=1:t_elite=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_SSGEOM:found=1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_SSFIRE:now=[0-9]+:cd_product=[0-9]+:cd_delta=200:cd_started=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_SSREAD:.*:t_hp=19[^:]*:.*:t_alive=1:t_elite=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_C3_SSGEOM:found=1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_C3_SSFIRE:now=[0-9]+:cd_product=0:cd_delta=-[0-9]+:cd_started=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
